    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with his consent. He has no written health care directive and has not named a health care agent. He would want full treatment, including surgery and intensive care, for any condition from which he could recover. He will choose an agent, talk through his wishes with that person, and bring the completed directive form given today to a future visit. [S]</paragraph></text>

